
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>

    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

    <title>Elegant Fashion Boutique</title>

    <style>

        /* =========================================
           BASIC STYLING
        ========================================= */

        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background: #fdf7f8;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }


        /* =========================================
           HEADER
           1. BORDER-RADIUS
        ========================================= */

        header {
            background: #8b3a62;
            color: white;
            padding: 25px;
            text-align: center;

            /* Rounded corners */
            border-radius: 0 0 30px 30px;
        }

        header h1 {
            font-size: 34px;
        }

        header p {
            margin-top: 5px;
            font-size: 17px;
        }


        /* =========================================
           NAVIGATION
        ========================================= */

        nav {
            background: #222;
        }

        nav ul {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            list-style: none;
        }

        nav li {
            padding: 15px 20px;
        }

        nav a {
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        nav li:hover {
            background: #8b3a62;
        }


        /* =========================================
           HERO SECTION
           3. MULTIPLE BACKGROUNDS
           4. BACKGROUND-SIZE
        ========================================= */

        .hero {

            padding: 60px 20px;
            text-align: center;

            /*
             Multiple background images.
             First background is the top layer.
             Second background is the bottom layer.
            */

            background-image:
                url("https://picsum.photos/1200/500?fashion"),
                linear-gradient(#f7dce7, #e8b8cc);

            background-position:
                center,
                center;

            background-repeat:
                no-repeat,
                no-repeat;

            /*
             background-size: cover
             makes the background fill the hero.
            */

            background-size:
                cover,
                cover;

            min-height: 300px;

            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: center;

            border-radius: 20px;

            margin: 20px;
        }

        .hero h2 {
            color: #8b3a62;
            font-size: 32px;

            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);

            padding: 10px;

            border-radius: 15px;
        }

        .hero p {
            margin-top: 10px;
            font-size: 18px;

            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);

            padding: 10px;

            border-radius: 10px;
        }


        /* =========================================
           MAIN CONTAINER
        ========================================= */

        .container {
            display: flex;
            padding: 25px;
            gap: 25px;
        }


        /* =========================================
           SIDEBAR
           1. BORDER-RADIUS
           2. BORDER-IMAGE
        ========================================= */

        .sidebar {

            width: 25%;
            background: white;
            padding: 20px;

            /* Rounded corners */
            border-radius: 20px;

            /*
             Border image.
             Keep border.png in the same folder
             as this HTML file.
            */

            border: 15px solid transparent;

            border-image:
                url("border.png") 30 round;
        }

        .sidebar h3 {
            color: #8b3a62;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .sidebar ul {
            list-style: none;
        }

        .sidebar li {
            padding: 12px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd;
        }

        .sidebar li:hover {
            background: #f7dce7;
        }


        /* =========================================
           CONTENT
        ========================================= */

        .content {
            width: 75%;
        }

        .content h2 {
            color: #8b3a62;
        }


        /* =========================================
           PRODUCT CARDS
           BORDER-RADIUS
        ========================================= */

        .cards {
            display: flex;
            gap: 20px;
            margin-top: 20px;
        }

        .card {

            flex: 1;

            background: white;

            padding: 15px;

            /* Rounded corners */
            border-radius: 20px;

            text-align: center;

            box-shadow: 0 0 8px #ccc;

            transition: transform 0.3s;
        }

        .card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
        }

        .card img {

            width: 100%;

            height: 220px;

            /*
             Image is completely fitted
             inside the card.
            */

            object-fit: cover;

            border-radius: 15px;
        }

        .card h3 {
            margin-top: 10px;
            color: #8b3a62;
        }

        .card p {
            margin-top: 8px;
        }

        .price {
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #333;
            margin-top: 8px;
        }


        /* =========================================
           6. ADJACENT SIBLING SELECTOR
           
           Hover over product name and the
           immediately following image becomes
           fully visible.
        ========================================= */

        .product-name {
            color: #8b3a62;
            font-weight: bold;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .product-preview {

            width: 100px;
            height: 70px;

            object-fit: cover;

            opacity: 0.2;

            border-radius: 10px;

            transition: opacity 0.3s ease;
        }

        /*
           Adjacent sibling selector

           A + B

           B is selected only when it
           immediately follows A.
        */

        .product-name:hover + .product-preview {
            opacity: 1;
        }


        /* =========================================
           BUTTON
           :HOVER PSEUDO-CLASS
        ========================================= */

        button {

            background: #8b3a62;

            color: white;

            padding: 10px 20px;

            border: none;

            margin-top: 12px;

            border-radius: 8px;

            cursor: pointer;
        }

        button:hover {
            background: #5f2442;
        }


        /* =========================================
           PSEUDO-CLASS FORM
           :FOCUS
           :REQUIRED
           :VALID
           :INVALID
        ========================================= */

        .form-section {

            background: white;

            margin-top: 30px;

            padding: 25px;

            border-radius: 20px;

            box-shadow: 0 0 8px #ccc;
        }

        .form-section h2 {

            color: #8b3a62;

            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .form-section label {

            display: block;

            margin-top: 10px;

            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .form-section input {

            width: 100%;

            padding: 12px;

            margin-top: 5px;

            border: 2px solid #ccc;

            border-radius: 8px;

            font-size: 16px;
        }


        /* :required */

        .form-section input:required {

            border: 2px solid #8b3a62;

            background: #fff5f8;
        }


        /* :focus */

        .form-section input:focus {

            outline: none;

            border: 3px solid #8b3a62;

            background: #ffeaf2;
        }


        /* :valid */

        .form-section input:valid {

            color: #8b3a62;
        }


        /* :invalid */

        .form-section input:invalid {

            color: red;
        }


        /* =========================================
           7. NTH-CHILD()
           FASHION COLLECTION TABLE
        ========================================= */

        .table-section {

            margin-top: 30px;

            background: white;

            padding: 25px;

            border-radius: 20px;

            box-shadow: 0 0 8px #ccc;
        }

        .table-section h2 {

            color: #8b3a62;

            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        #fashionTable {

            width: 100%;

            border-collapse: collapse;
        }

        #fashionTable th,
        #fashionTable td {

            padding: 12px;

            text-align: center;

            border: 1px solid #ccc;
        }

        #fashionTable th {

            background: #8b3a62;

            color: white;
        }


        /*
           nth-child(odd)
        */

        #fashionTable tr:nth-child(odd) {

            background: #fdf0f5;
        }


        /*
           nth-child(even)
        */

        #fashionTable tr:nth-child(even) {

            background: #f7dce7;
        }


        /*
           Hover over table row
        */

        #fashionTable tr:hover {

            background: #ffd1e2;
        }


        /* =========================================
           FOOTER
        ========================================= */

        footer {

            background: #222;

            color: white;

            padding: 25px;

            text-align: center;

            margin-top: 20px;

            border-radius: 25px 25px 0 0;
        }


        /* =========================================
           TABLET
        ========================================= */

        @media screen and (max-width: 992px) {

            .container {

                flex-direction: column;
            }

            .sidebar,
            .content {

                width: 100%;
            }

            .cards {

                flex-wrap: wrap;
            }

            .card {

                width: 45%;
            }

        }


        /* =========================================
           MOBILE
        ========================================= */

        @media screen and (max-width: 768px) {

            nav ul {

                flex-direction: column;

                text-align: center;
            }

            nav li {

                padding: 12px;
            }

            .cards {

                flex-direction: column;
            }

            .card {

                width: 100%;
            }

            .hero {

                padding: 40px 20px;
            }

            .hero h2 {

                font-size: 26px;
            }

            .container {

                flex-direction: column;
            }

        }


        /* =========================================
           SMALL MOBILE
        ========================================= */

        @media screen and (max-width: 480px) {

            header h1 {

                font-size: 25px;
            }

            .hero h2 {

                font-size: 22px;
            }

            button {

                width: 100%;
            }

            .container {

                padding: 15px;
            }

            .form-section,
            .table-section {

                padding: 15px;
            }

        }

    </style>

</head>


<body>


    <!-- =========================================
         HEADER
    ========================================== -->

    <header>

        <h1>Elegant Fashion Boutique</h1>

        <p>Style • Elegance • Confidence</p>

    </header>


    <!-- =========================================
         NAVIGATION
    ========================================== -->

    <nav>

        <ul>

            <li><a href="#">Home</a></li>

            <li><a href="#">Women</a></li>

            <li><a href="#">Men</a></li>

            <li><a href="#">Accessories</a></li>

            <li><a href="#">Contact</a></li>

        </ul>

    </nav>


    <!-- =========================================
         HERO SECTION
         Multiple Backgrounds
         Background Size: Cover
    ========================================== -->

    <section class="hero">

        <h2>Discover Your Signature Style</h2>

        <p>
            Explore the latest fashion trends and find
            outfits that express your unique personality.
        </p>

    </section>


    <!-- =========================================
         MAIN CONTAINER
    ========================================== -->

    <div class="container">


        <!-- =====================================
             SIDEBAR
             Border Image + Border Radius
        ====================================== -->

        <div class="sidebar">

            <h3>Shop Categories</h3>

            <ul>

                <li>Women's Wear</li>

                <li>Men's Wear</li>

                <li>Traditional Wear</li>

                <li>Western Wear</li>

                <li>Accessories</li>

                <li>Footwear</li>

            </ul>

        </div>


        <!-- =====================================
             CONTENT
        ====================================== -->

        <div class="content">

            <h2>Latest Fashion Collection</h2>

            <p>
                Discover our carefully selected collection
                of stylish and elegant fashion pieces.
            </p>


            <!-- =================================
                 PRODUCT CARDS
            ================================== -->

            <div class="cards">


                <!-- PRODUCT 1 -->

                <div class="card">

                    <img
                        src="dress1.jpg"
                        alt="Elegant Dress">

                    <h3>Elegant Dress</h3>

                    <p>
                        Beautiful and comfortable dress
                        perfect for special occasions.
                    </p>

                    <p class="price">
                        ₹1,499
                    </p>

                    <button>
                        Shop Now
                    </button>

                </div>


                <!-- PRODUCT 2 -->

                <div class="card">

                    <img
                        src="dress2.jpg"
                        alt="Traditional Outfit">

                    <h3>Traditional Outfit</h3>

                    <p>
                        Stylish traditional wear designed
                        for celebrations and festivals.
                    </p>

                    <p class="price">
                        ₹1,999
                    </p>

                    <button>
                        Shop Now
                    </button>

                </div>


                <!-- PRODUCT 3 -->

                <div class="card">

                    <img
                        src="dress3.jpg"
                        alt="Fashion Accessories">

                    <h3>Fashion Accessories</h3>

                    <p>
                        Complete your look with our
                        beautiful collection of accessories.
                    </p>

                    <p class="price">
                        ₹799
                    </p>

                    <button>
                        Shop Now
                    </button>

                </div>


            </div>


            <!-- =================================
                 ADJACENT SIBLING DEMONSTRATION
            ================================== -->

            <div class="form-section">

                <h2>Featured Fashion</h2>

                <p class="product-name">
                    Hover over this text to reveal the image
                </p>

                <img
                    class="product-preview"
                    src="dress1.jpg"
                    alt="Fashion Preview">

                <p style="margin-top:15px;">

                    This demonstrates the
                    <b>adjacent sibling selector (+)</b>.

                    The image immediately following the
                    text changes its opacity when the
                    text is hovered.

                </p>

            </div>


            <!-- =================================
                 PSEUDO-CLASS FORM
            ================================== -->

            <div class="form-section">

                <h2>Join Our Fashion Newsletter</h2>

                <form>

                    <label for="name">
                        Name:
                    </label>

                    <input
                        type="text"
                        id="name"
                        placeholder="Enter your name"
                        required>


                    <label for="email">
                        Email:
                    </label>

                    <input
                        type="email"
                        id="email"
                        placeholder="name@example.com"
                        required>


                    <button type="submit">
                        Subscribe
                    </button>

                </form>

                <p style="margin-top:15px;">

                    Enter an invalid email and then a valid
                    email to observe the
                    <b>:invalid</b> and <b>:valid</b>
                    pseudo-classes.

                </p>

            </div>


            <!-- =================================
                 NTH-CHILD TABLE
            ================================== -->

            <div class="table-section">

                <h2>Popular Fashion Categories</h2>

                <table id="fashionTable">

                    <tr>

                        <th>Category</th>

                        <th>Style</th>

                        <th>Price Range</th>

                    </tr>

                    <tr>

                        <td>Women's Wear</td>

                        <td>Elegant</td>

                        <td>₹1,000 - ₹3,000</td>

                    </tr>

                    <tr>

                        <td>Men's Wear</td>

                        <td>Classic</td>

                        <td>₹1,500 - ₹4,000</td>

                    </tr>

                    <tr>

                        <td>Traditional Wear</td>

                        <td>Festive</td>

                        <td>₹2,000 - ₹5,000</td>

                    </tr>

                    <tr>

                        <td>Western Wear</td>

                        <td>Modern</td>

                        <td>₹1,000 - ₹3,500</td>

                    </tr>

                    <tr>

                        <td>Accessories</td>

                        <td>Trendy</td>

                        <td>₹500 - ₹2,000</td>

                    </tr>

                    <tr>

                        <td>Footwear</td>

                        <td>Stylish</td>

                        <td>₹800 - ₹2,500</td>

                    </tr>

                </table>

                <p style="margin-top:15px;">

                    The table uses
                    <b>:nth-child(odd)</b> and
                    <b>:nth-child(even)</b> to create
                    alternating row colors.

                    Hover over a row to highlight it.

                </p>

            </div>


        </div>

    </div>


    <!-- =========================================
         FOOTER
    ========================================== -->

    <footer>

        <h3>Elegant Fashion Boutique</h3>

        <p>
            Fashion that makes you feel confident.
        </p>

        <p>
            © 2026 Elegant Fashion Boutique
        </p>

    </footer>


</body>

</html>

